1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,117
Blende is a sulphide, so it too is concentrated by froth flotation.

2
00:00:05,117 --> 00:00:09,921
It is then roasted in air at about twelve hundred kelvin to zinc oxide.

3
00:00:09,921 --> 00:00:12,330
Calamine is simply calcined.

4
00:00:12,330 --> 00:00:17,226
The sulphur dioxide is not wasted: it goes to make sulphuric acid.

